@host = http://localhost:5283
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@vehicleDriverId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@vehicleId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@pageNumber = 1
@pageSize = 10

### VehicleDriver - Get by Id
GET {{host}}/api/v1/VehicleDriver/{{vehicleDriverId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### VehicleDriver - Get Paging
GET {{host}}/api/v1/VehicleDriver/Paging/{{pageNumber}}/{{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### VehicleDriver - Create
POST {{host}}/api/v1/VehicleDriver
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}

###

### VehicleDriver - Update
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/VehicleDriver
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "id": "{{vehicleDriverId}}"
}

###

### VehicleDriver - Delete
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/VehicleDriver/{{vehicleDriverId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### VehicleDriver View - Get All
GET {{host}}/api/v1/VehicleDriver/view
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### VehicleDriver View - Get Paging
GET {{host}}/api/v1/VehicleDriver/view/paging/{{pageNumber}}/{{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### VehicleDriver View - Get by Id
GET {{host}}/api/v1/VehicleDriver/view/{{vehicleDriverId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### VehicleDriver View - Get by VehicleId
GET {{host}}/api/v1/VehicleDriver/view/Vehicle/{{vehicleId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### VehicleDriver View - Get by VehicleId Paging
GET {{host}}/api/v1/VehicleDriver/view/Vehicle/{{vehicleId}}/Paging/{{pageNumber}}/{{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###


